[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275765956","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118744#issuecomment-4275765956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118744","id":4275765956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-2wLE","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-19T11:06:52Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T11:06:52Z","body":"The default behaviour should either be not installing anything or asking in an interactive prompt. Default behaviour that installs software on a system without any interaction or opt-in, is a pattern that I'd expect from some shady installer not from our buildsystem.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275765956/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275774593","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118744#issuecomment-4275774593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118744","id":4275774593,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-2ySB","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-19T11:12:59Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T11:12:59Z","body":"> Default behaviour that installs software on a system without any interaction or opt-in, is a pattern that I'd expect from some shady installer not from our buildsystem.\r\n\r\nI strongly disagree. It's not installing software, only downloading build dependencies (static libraries headers). No one would expect build command to be interactive and this will break existing workflows.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275774593/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4281563472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118744#issuecomment-4281563472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118744","id":4281563472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_M3lQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T14:19:32Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T14:20:57Z","body":"While it might seem intrusive at first, I tend to agree with this approach (especially in 2026).\r\n\r\nAs long as we keep an offline mode for Linux distribution packages (including Flatpaks on Flathub), this should make the out-of-the-box developer experience significantly better. This is especially the case now that we have several dependencies that are *expected* to be compiled in most production-quality builds (we have 7 `misc/scripts/install_*` scripts right now).\r\n\r\nThis does not install distribution packages (which would require superuser privileges), so there's no risk of `sudo` prompts blocking installation. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/43377 adds a script that installs those dependencies, but if we go forward with this approach, I don't think it should be called automatically for that reason.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4281563472/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":6,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4281643888","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118744#issuecomment-4281643888","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118744","id":4281643888,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_NLNw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T14:28:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T14:28:39Z","body":"Yeah I might have overreacted there, due to reading \"install\" in the name and the fact that it's common under Linux to install development headers as system packages.\r\n\r\nSo just to clarify:\r\n- I consider those things no-gos: installing system packages, modifying environment variables, downloading into not Godot specific locations\r\n- as long as stuff is downloaded into some Godot specific folder and the buildsystem picks it up from there automatically, that seems fine to me. After reading into those scripts a bit more this seems to be the case, sorry!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4281643888/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4282138911","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118744#issuecomment-4282138911","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118744","id":4282138911,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_PEEf","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T15:28:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T15:28:42Z","body":"Should we move away from the \"install\" terminology to prevent this legitimate confusion? AFAIK we download and either unzip in `LOCALAPPDATA/Godot/build_deps` on Windows or `bin/build_deps` elsewhere.\r\n\r\nAnd maybe move the scripts in something like `misc/build_deps/` and factor out some common logic in some helper scripts.\r\n\r\nThis may be out of scope for this PR though, aside from deciding on the name of the new SCons option.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4282138911/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4282846705","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118744#issuecomment-4282846705","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118744","id":4282846705,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_Rw3x","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T17:16:38Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T17:16:38Z","body":"Definitely move away from \"install\" to avoid confusing people","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4282846705/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4283563730","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118744#issuecomment-4283563730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118744","id":4283563730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_Uf7S","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T19:07:33Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T19:07:33Z","body":"I think that someone invoking \"scons\" does not expect anything to be downloaded automatically. I too would consider this a hostile default, and very surprising. \r\n\r\nI would like to suggest the following:\r\n* Add an \"download_dependencies=yes\" option, but off by default \r\n* When a user invokes scons manually in an interactive shell offer to download, explain that there's a command-line option to do it automatically \r\n* When a user invokes scons from a non-interactive shell do not download anything and retain prior behavior\r\n\r\nI would never in a million years expect a project that isn't using yarn or cargo etc to suddenly without warning start to download stuff during build when previously it did not. \r\n\r\nI would consider it a breach of trust if it did.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4283563730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4286561767","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118744#issuecomment-4286561767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118744","id":4286561767,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_f73n","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-21T07:08:06Z","updated_at":"2026-04-21T07:08:06Z","body":"Renamed option and scripts to `download` (except MoltenVK, which actually install system-wide SDK) and moved scripts to `misc/build_deps`.\r\n\r\nFor MoltenVK, it might be reasonable to switch to `https://github.com/godotengine/moltenvk-osxcross/releases` and only download the framework (at least for automatic download).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4286561767/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]